GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2541950,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2541950","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:32:25Z","value":6,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5189600","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1846651706691700","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"SIRENS Demo is here!","summary":"Hi everyone! The SIRENS demo has just become part of Steam Next Fest! This is our first official opportunity to showcase the game to such a large audience, so we’d like to thank you for all the feedback you shared with us earlier. Thanks to you, we’ve been able to fix a huge number of bugs and polish the areas that needed some extra attention. In today’s game update, we’ve also added gamepad support. (We’re still working on it, though, so it’s not quite perfect yet!) We’d be incredibly grateful ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691700","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1844751498224810","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet our new heroine - Lyra!","summary":"Hi! Our crowdfunding campaign has reached its goal, and we’re celebrating with something special! ❤️ Meet our new heroine - Lyra! And there’s still time to be part of the journey! Our campaign is ongoing, so you can still support SIERNS and get exclusive rewards along the way.A huge thank you to everyone who has supported us so far. This is just the beginning! 🖤👉 Join the adventure and claim your rewards! https://gamefound.com/en/projects/silent-lamb-studio/sirens Don't forget to add SIRENS to y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T14:50:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1842846814455754","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"The SIRENS campaign on Gamefound has just launched.","summary":"Hi, You can now support SIRENS development directly via our Gamefound Campaign: https://gamefound.com/pl/projects/silent-lamb-studio/sirens We’ve prepared a wide range of exciting rewards for you. This is your unique opportunity to become part of the world of SIRENS while helping us bring the game to life. Backers will get access to the game’s demo during the campaign. SIRENS wouldn’t be where it is today without you. It’s all thanks to your support and the fact that you’re sharing our game with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T14:04:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1840310314345142","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Gameplay Reveal","summary":"Hello!As promised, we're excited to share the very first official gameplay showcase for Sirens with you!We're launching our crowdfunding campaign on Indiegogo very soon, and we'd greatly appreciate your support. Every contribution will help us dedicate more time and resources to improving the game's quality, and that's something we all want to see. Exploration is extremely important to us, which is why we’re building systems that allow for deeper immersion in the world.To make exploring the unde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T14:21:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345142","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1832700592786296","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"Northern Isle preview","summary":"Hi!Today we’ve prepared a small preview of one of the locations in the game. These materials were previously available to our supporters on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/c/silentlamb/posts When designing the world of Sirens, we started with the idea that, for better immersion, the world above water should be just as engaging and rich as the one beneath it. That’s why we place great emphasis on detail, striving to bring life to the environments around us. The island has its own story, which we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T13:13:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786296","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1827626365763674","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Nyr!","summary":"Hello, We invite you to check out the new trailer showcasing one of the main characters of Sirens, a mermaid named “Nyr.” Do you like the direction the project is heading? We encourage you to support the game on PATREON. Based on feedback from you as well as our own impressions, we decided to change the appearance of the main character, taking into account the conditions she would realistically have to live in. The game uses the latest technologies of the Unreal Engine 5, but we are focused on n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-23T14:49:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365763674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1822556746156793","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"New Mermaid Design","summary":"Hello everyone! We have a special update for you regarding Sirens. After a long break, we've resumed work on the game and we can't wait to share new content with you! We're currently working on the game with a small team of just a few people and need your support. That's why we've launched an official Patreon for Sirens, and we'd be very grateful if you'd check it out! In return, we want to share new content with you, including sketches, prototypes, and even playable alpha versions, as well as o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-21T14:12:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746156793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2541950-1794102528100607","game_id":"steam-2541950","kind":"announcement","title":"Madnight 2025 Has Ended – Now the Hellish wait begins!","summary":"The World of Agony is growing! Dear fans! We are pleased to announce that our universe, connecting all the games we produce, is growing even more, thanks to the Tormentor, in which you will find a lot of references to Agony, Succubus or Paranoid. But that's not all. During Madnight 2025, we answered your questions about Sirens, Lust of God, Agony: Lords of Hell and we revealed many details about these productions. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44789964/602226a5d967c7d37c8d2a7b777e6e538d8a1d64.gif Madnight ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-14T08:16:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528100607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2541950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2541950":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2541950":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z"},"5189600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:17Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2541950","app_id":2541950,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5d1748d70693ffbe48a55d65e4caad53582a576f3fa645c6660b4f07600d6d6c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Become a deadly Siren and hunt down the most dangerous sea creatures that have ever swim in the depths of the oceans! Experience a fascinating journey through the world as seen from the perspective of Sirens at various stages of their evolution.","publishers":[{"name":"Silent Lamb Studio"}],"developers":[{"name":"Silent Lamb Studio"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Lyra: Character Reveal Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790350531","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2541950/1696461123/6a26e5e00a4b765ae154cd89ee345b81a5ad4ede/1790348046/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filenam